anguage":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"A modular, single source proof-of-concept for technical docs.","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"EmeraldCityIT/Use-of-Transportation-of-Double-Latch-Gate-Coils-at-Airports","owner":"EmeraldCityIT","html_url":"https://github.com/EmeraldCityIT/Use-of-Transportation-of-Double-Latch-Gate-Coils-at-Airports","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Double Latch Gate Coils can be used to transport personnel and cargo through airports. This method allows for affordable interstate or international transportation.","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"EmeraldCityIT/Logistics-via-Double-Latch-Gate-Coil","owner":"EmeraldCityIT","html_url":"https://github.com/EmeraldCityIT/Logistics-via-Double-Latch-Gate-Coil","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Package Shipping can be done via warehouses with double latch gate coils (running gates) which create interstate / interregional connections. For simple transportation to custom locations, two trucks with matching double latch gate coils can be sent to a pickup and dropoff/delivery point. The transportation of cargo can exist through the gates, without road transportation of cargo.","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"Wolfecode/ChessMimic","owner":"Wolfecode","html_url":"https://github.com/Wolfecode/ChessMimic","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Chess AI that can play in the style of a given player. Chess AI currently are either algorithm based, and play like engines or they are highly trained 3000+ rated neural nets that are better than the world's best players. The goal of this project is to create a chess AI that plays at the skill level and in the style of a certain player. For example it can be trained on Anatoly Karpov and would play positionally, or if it were trained on Mihail Tal it would be aggressive and sacrifice frequently.","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"Wolfecode/GuessTheElo","owner":"Wolfecode","html_url":"https://github.com/Wolfecode/GuessTheElo","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Chess AI that can guess the elo rating of chess players based on just a PNG game. In the future, look at what elo is required to see a certain move for a player.","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"Wolfecode/SocialStock","owner":"Wolfecode","html_url":"https://github.com/Wolfecode/SocialStock","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"An app that lets you trade social media as a stock. Invest in new creators you think will do well. If they do better than expected, get rewarded.","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"levi-kohler/react_dictionary","owner":"levi-kohler","html_url":"https://github.com/levi-kohler/react_dictionary","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"MattNotarangelo/pic16f886-radio-asm","owner":"MattNotarangelo","html_url":"https://github.com/MattNotarangelo/pic16f886-radio-asm","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Assembly","description":"PIC16F886 radio written in assembly","topics":[],"score":2174},{"name":"adrienneeaston/portfolio-webpage","owner":"adrienneeaston","html_url":"https://github.com/adrienneeaston/portfolio-webpage","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2174}]